[gd_scene load_steps=2 format=3]

; A WALL, one grid line long (Quaternius, Updated Modular Dungeon, CC0). 2 x 2 units and 0.44 thick,
; stood up on its line and fitted to a square by BoardTiles; Board.Cutaway sets how tall. Also the
; block of rock that fills a # square (stretched deep to fill it).
; The pack ships no glTF, so this is its OBJ and .mtl (tools/pull-models.ps1) in a one-node scene, like
; game/models/minis/rat.tscn. The painted shader on the board relights the .mtl's flat colours.

[ext_resource type="Mesh" path="res://models/dungeon/Wall_Modular.obj" id="1_mesh"]

